icial  snow is used  in in i mean a consistent way for  decades you know in a winter competitive  sport what is really important like for  any other activities  that  we we practice is to try to do it in the  most efficient way  with the lead up to the olympics  dominated by politics and covert 19 most  of the athletes will hope the focus now  shifts to the action as nearly 3 000  competitors from 91 nations fight to  take home a gold medal david stokes al  jazeera
 

